# The Hive: the private companion repository (scripts/hive.mjs) laid over this checkout. It holds the build
# logs, the proof files, the spec and the one-off proof scripts. These lines keep every one of its paths out
# of the public repository; scripts/hive.test.mjs fails if a line is missing or a Hive file is tracked.
